    "description": "Searching for the reliable Qibla Finder app for regular days or Ramadan? Look no further than Prayer times & Qibla Finder - a useful Qibla compass that enables Muslims to locate Qibla direction from any location in the world. Thanks to this namaz times app, all Muslims are now able to find the direction of Qibla more quickly and accurately.\r\n\r\nOur namaz times app is one of the most optimized apps for Muslims with lots of features including:\r\n\ud83d\udd4c Qibla Finder to easily navigate your spiritual trip and find the way to Makkah with Qibla compass.\r\n\ud83d\udd4c Muslim prayer Notifications according to users\u2019 location to avoid missing prayer times.\r\n\ud83d\udd4c 99 Names of Allah in Arabic with beautiful meanings.\r\n\ud83d\udd4c Azkar for morning and evening prayers in detail to recite.\r\n\ud83d\udd4c Digital Tasbih Counter for praying purpose\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd11 <b>MUSLIM PRAYER TIMES & QIBLA FINDER MAIN FEATURES:</b>\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd4b <b><font color=\"#1b8956\">QIBLA FINDER WITH PRAYER TIMES APP</font></b>\r\n\u25fe This feature of Qibla compass would help you locate Qibla direction from anywhere in the world.\r\n\u25fe Muslim prayer would be informed about the way and the distance from Mecca.\r\n\u25fe In order to run Qibla Finder feature smoothly, place your device on flat surface then move it until compass turns green.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd4b <b><font color=\"#1b8956\">PRAYER NOTIFICATIONS WITH QIBLA FINDER APP</font></b>\r\n\u25fe Prayer notifications of Qibla compass would help you avoid missing prayer times by sending notifications.\r\n\u25fe Muslim prayer can also check namaz times for Fajr, Dhuhr, Asr, Maghrib and Isha everyday quickly and correctly.\r\n\u25fe Prayer times also show Islamic Calendar or Hijri Calendar for users\u2019 convenience.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd4b <b><font color=\"#1b8956\">99 NAMES OF ALLAH</font></b>\r\n\u25fe In addition to Qibla compass, our namaz times app also provides 99 meaningful names of Allah in Arabic.\r\n\u25fe To fully understand the name, you can see the meaning of those names.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd4b <b><font color=\"#1b8956\">AZKAR FOR MORNING AND EVENING PRAYER TIMES & QIBLA FINDER</font></b>\r\n\u25fe Our namaz times app also provides morning and evening Azkar.\r\n\u25fe The Azkar is written in detail so Muslim prayer can recite easily.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd4b <b><font color=\"#1b8956\">DIGITAL TASBIH COUNTER</font></b>\r\n\u25fe With this feature, you can participate in Dhikr while on the go.\r\n\u25fe You can customize vibration, sound modes and targets.\r\n\r\n\u26a0\ufe0f NOTE:\r\nPlease adjust your settings for accurate Muslim prayer times and Qibla compass. In most situations, enabling auto-settings guarantees the most accurate prayer times.\r\n\r\nDownload Qibla Finder & prayer times now to find Qibla direction, receive prayer notifications and Azkar for morning and evening prayers. If you find our namaz times app useful, give us 5 stars as an encouragement to develop more high-quality apps.\r\n\r\nShould you have any question, feel free to contact us at feedback@govo.tech",
